#19900
The 10 trials of Hercules.~
The 10 trials of Hercules are based on the Greek Mythology.  
It was actually spelled Hercales but everyone knows it as 
Hercules.  This will be for groups of level 20-50.  No soloing
will be possible.   Paths extend from a 4x4 area leading to a 
mob a piece.  Each mob will carry the key to the next.  Therefore,
the monster must be done in the same order as Hercules killed 
them.  Hopefully this will be a little education thing too 
*chuckle*
Creator is Diamond/Bupp.
~
199 4 0 0 0 4 255 0
S
#19901
A small path.~
A grass covered path leads to the north.  The trees sway through
the soft winds blowing from the east.  A few birds can be seen 
in the tree tops.  To the south a door can be made out in the 
wall of Olympus.
~
