E
hercules statue~
     Hercules towers above you in a thick marble form.  Scripture
is written at his feet:

Hercules had to perform 10 harsh trials to gain forgiveness for
the death he had brought upon his wife and children and to gain
his god-hood.  Hercules walked the paths that lie before you and
triumphed over all that dared to slow his pace.  

Ahead of  you lies the 10 trials... Find your place in the stars.
~
