A forest.~
     The giant trees crowd together in this area, making it hard
for light to break through the wall of limbs and tree-tops. Bushes
are scattered through the trees allowing easy passage.  Birds can
be seen flying from tree-top to tree-top.  A path leads to the
west and east.
~
