#19993
Shores of a crystal blue sea.~
A crystal blue sea pounds the shore here with it's tremendous
walls of water.  The waves call to you as a finger would, rolling
in and out, inviting you to enter it's body.  A movement catches
your eyes near the edge of the water.  It appears to be a 
large fish... wait it is an octypus... no a starfish?  What the
hell is it?  You are reminded of the old greek myth of a man that
holds great knowledge and has the powers to transform himself into
any creature of the sea.
~
